WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.290
Step 1. Open the Dispense History sub-tab.

1.2
00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:08.646
Here you view the dispenses of an encounter, one dispense order at a time.

1.3
00:00:08.646 --> 00:00:12.186
Select Medications, then Dispense History.

2.1
00:00:12.186 --> 00:00:14.576
Step 2. Select a dispense order.

2.2
00:00:14.576 --> 00:00:19.460
The list shows the patient's dispense orders, also from other encounters.

2.3
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:24.644
Care selects the first one. Select another order to see its dispenses.

3.1
00:00:24.644 --> 00:00:26.789
Step 3. Read the dispenses.

3.2
00:00:26.789 --> 00:00:32.194
The table shows each Medicine with its Dosage, Frequency, Quantity, Location,

3.3
00:00:32.194 --> 00:00:33.668
Status and Bill Time.

3.4
00:00:33.668 --> 00:00:39.433
A dispense from the encounter's Dispense drawer has no dosage instructions.
